>>The guide will assign 25 quests that it will later instruct you to prepare for your Quest Log. |cRXP_WARN_These quests are optimized for XP/HR|r meaning you might see quests awarding |cRXP_WARN_more flat XP|r than what you got assigned but |cRXP_WARN_they're less efficient to turn in|r since they require more running. They serve as a backup
>>You can change which quests you want to do by opening the Quest List and clicking the |cRXP_PICK_Edit|r button. That being said |cRXP_WARN_we suggest using the recommended quests unless you get assigned something that you specifially don't want to bother preparing!|r
>>The quests |cRXP_WARN_"Glyph Chasing"|r and |cRXP_WARN_"Breaking the Code"|r are a |cRXP_WARN_very high priority to keep in log|r since they allow you to start the turn in section at the camp in southern Silithus which is the |cRXP_WARN_most efficient route|r. << Alliance
